WEBVTT

00:09:00.995 --> 00:09:03.205
You know, in fact,

00:09:03.205 --> 00:09:05.958
three of these areas alone
in the Northwest Territories

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:09.503
span 50,000 square kilometers in size.

00:09:10.170 --> 00:09:12.214
That's about the size of Costa Rica.

00:09:13.299 --> 00:09:15.301
The Kaska Dena
in northern British Columbia

00:09:15.342 --> 00:09:18.387
are planning to create
a protected area the size of Switzerland.

00:09:18.846 --> 00:09:20.347
And in northern Manitoba,

00:09:20.389 --> 00:09:22.725
four Dene and Cree nations
are coming together

00:09:22.725 --> 00:09:25.394
to protect the Seal River Watershed,

00:09:25.394 --> 00:09:28.647
home to caribou, belugas, polar bears

00:09:28.689 --> 00:09:30.858
and thousands of songbirds.